{"id":"C8","doc":"C","title":"Consolidated Pin Overview","words":194,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The datasheet's Table 7-1 "},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Consolidated Pin Overview"}]},{"t":"text","v":" (datasheet page 79) is a single wide table that combines, for all 57 pins, the columns of "},{"t":"xref","id":"C2.2","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Table 2-1 Pin Overview"}]},{"t":"text","v":" (pin type, pin providing power, At Reset / After Reset), "},{"t":"xref","id":"C2.3.2","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Table 2-6 RTC Functions"}]},{"t":"text","v":" (RTC IO MUX F0/F3), "},{"t":"xref","id":"C2.3.3","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Table 2-8 Analog Functions"}]},{"t":"text","v":" (F0/F1) and "},{"t":"xref","id":"C2.3.1","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Table 2-4 IO MUX Functions"}]},{"t":"text","v":" (F0-F4 with types)."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Its values repeat those tables and are not duplicated here; use the C2 tables."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Its highlighting (red: in-package flash/"},{"t":"block","v":"PSRAM","id":"flash-psram"},{"t":"text","v":" pins; yellow: pins with important functions) follows "},{"t":"xref","id":"C2.3.4","c":[{"t":"text","v":"C2.3.4"}]},{"t":"text","v":", and its footnote reads: \"For details, see "},{"t":"xref","id":"C2","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Section 2"}]},{"t":"text","v":" Pins."}]},{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Regarding highlighted cells, see "},{"t":"xref","id":"C2.3.4","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Section 2.3.4"}]},{"t":"text","v":" Restrictions for GPIOs and RTC_GPIOs.\""}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Differences from C2, as printed in the datasheet (both values kept):"}]}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Pin"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Item"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Table 2-4 (C2.3.1)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Table 7-1 (this chapter)"}]],"rows":[{"n":6,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"36 ("},{"t":"field","v":"SPICLK_N"},{"t":"text","v":")"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IO MUX F0 / F2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"SPICLK_N_DIFF / SUBSPICLK_N_DIFF; F1 = "}